ody-03-medium text-light w-variant-46c0186a-b320-580c-ae89-f5480cc0f27c">Get Started</div></div></a></div></div><div class="menu-button w-nav-button"><div class="icon w-icon-nav-menu"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="440717e7-7695-15b0-715a-ef83ca50bed6" class="nav-blur"></div></div><div class="page-wrapper"><section class="career-details"><div class="container"><div class="career-details-wrap"><div class="career-details-top"><div class="career-details-heading"><div class="hero-heading"><h2>Forward Deployed Engineer, Agentic Platform (EMEA &amp; APAC)</h2></div><div data-w-id="9ce689f3-ce3f-ab72-7fb8-4d801e68848e" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(5px)" class="career-box-wrap-1"><div class="career-info-box"><div class="dot-icon"></div><div class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">Full time</div></div><div class="career-info-box"><div class="dot-icon"></div><div class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">United Kingdom</div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="83725ff1-ef2d-1ecb-66fc-8790088e5579" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(5px)" class="career-details-form"><div class="form-block w-form"><div class="career-form-heading"><div class="heading-05">Apply for this Job</div></div><form id="wf-form-Apply-Job" name="wf-form-Apply-Job" data-name="Apply Job" method="get" class="career-form" data-wf-page-id="691571b1d17c900e020b14af" data-wf-element-id="0454d1d4-2859-446f-3aee-416eb909f412"><div class="career-form-block-wrap"><div class="career-form-block-wrap-v1"><div class="career-form-block-v2"><label for="First-Name" class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">First Name <span class="text-warning">*</span></label><input class="text-field-v2 w-input" maxlength="256" name="First-Name" data-name="First Name" placeholder="" type="text" id="First-Name" required=""/></div><div class="career-form-block-v2"><label for="Last-Name" class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">Last Name</label><input class="text-field-v2 w-input" maxlength="256" name="Last-Name" data-name="Last Name" placeholder="" type="text" id="Last-Name"/></div></div><div class="career-form-block-wrap-v1"><div class="career-form-block-v2"><label for="email" class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">Email Address <span class="text-warning">*</span></label><input class="text-field-v2 w-input" maxlength="256" name="email" data-name="Email" placeholder="" type="email" id="email" required=""/></div><div class="career-form-block-v2"><label for="Phone" class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">Phone Number</label><input class="text-field-v2 w-input" maxlength="256" name="Phone" data-name="Phone" placeholder="" type="tel" id="Phone" required=""/></div></div><div class="career-form-block-v2"><label for="Url" class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">Linkedin URL <span class="text-warning">*</span></label><input class="text-field-v2 w-input" maxlength="256" name="Url" data-name="Url" placeholder="" type="url" id="Url" required=""/></div><div class="career-form-block-v2"><label for="Located" class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">Where are you located?</label><input class="text-field-v2 w-input" maxlength="256" name="Located" data-name="Located" placeholder="" type="text" id="Located"/></div><div class="career-form-block-v2"><label for="email" class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">Tell us more about you <span class="text-warning">*</span></label><textarea required="" placeholder="" maxlength="5000" id="field" name="field" data-name="Field" class="text-field-v2 v3 w-input"></textarea></div></div><div class="career-form-button"><input type="submit" data-wait="Please wait..." class="normal-submit-button w-button" value="Submit Now"/></div></form><div class="success-message w-form-done"><div class="paragraph-02 text-light">Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class="error-message w-form-fail"><div class="paragraph-03">Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="career-details-bottom"><div data-w-id="24c3d599-98ad-a9de-48da-4cd93e9e793d" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(5px)" class="career-rich-text w-richtext"><h4>About Rebuild</h4><p>We’re looking for a skilled Webflow Developer to join our growing team at Rebuild. As a Webflow Developer, you’ll be responsible for building and maintaining high-quality, responsive websites using Webflow. You’ll collaborate closely with designers and project managers to bring creative concepts to life, ensuring every website is fast, functional, and optimized for performance.</p><h4>Why Us</h4><p>We value personal growth and offer continuous learning opportunities, flexible work arrangements, and a culture that fosters creativity. If you&#x27;re looking to make a real impact and be part of a team that values your contributions, Rebuild is the place for you.</p><h4>Responsibilities:</h4><ul role="list"><li>Build custom, responsive websites using Webflow, ensuring they align with the design vision and technical requirements.</li><li>Collaborate with designers to implement visually stunning and user-friendly layouts.</li><li>Ensure all websites are optimized for performance, SEO, and accessibility.</li><li>Troubleshoot and debug any issues that arise during development and after launch.</li><li>Work with the team to ensure projects are delivered on time and meet client expectations.</li><li>Continuously stay up-to-date with Webflow’s features, tools, and best practices.</li><li>Assist in the development and integration of third-party tools and custom code when necessary.</li><li>Proficiency in Webflow, including building custom interactions and animations.</li><li>Strong understanding of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.</li><li>Experience with responsive web design and cross-browser compatibility.</li><li>Knowledge of SEO best practices and performance optimization techniques.</li><li>Ability to collaborate effectively with designers and other team members.</li></ul><p>We believe in creating a supportive, dynamic environment where your skills can truly shine. We offer the opportunity to work on exciting, high-impact projects that push the boundaries of web design and development. Our team is collaborative, innovative, and passionate about delivering exceptional results.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="career"><div class="container"><div class="career-wrap"><div class="career-top v2"><div class="headding-wrap"><h2>Let’s build the future Together</h2></div></div><div class="career-bottom"><div data-w-id="85ceecb5-47a7-d4be-be37-5adaf1c3688d" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(5px)" class="career-title-box"><div class="sub-heading-02">Open Positions(72)</div></div><div class="career-positionwrap"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="career-collection-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="career-box-wrap"><div class="career-box-left"><div class="text-style-h6">Forward Deployed Engineer, Agentic Platform (EMEA &amp; APAC)</div><div class="career-box-wrap-1"><div class="career-info-box"><div class="dot-icon"></div><div class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">Full time</div></div><div class="career-info-box"><div class="dot-icon"></div><div class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">United Kingdom</div></div></div></div><div class="career-page-block"><a href="/career/forward-deployed-engineer-agentic-platform-emea-apac" data-w-id="85ceecb5-47a7-d4be-be37-5adaf1c3689f" aria-current="page" class="button-02 v2 w-inline-block w--current"><div class="button-text-wrapper"><div class="body-03-medium text-primary-color-01">Join Now</div><div class="body-03-medium text-light">Join Now</div></div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="career-box-wrap"><div class="career-box-left"><div class="text-style-h6">Senior/Staff Full-Stack Engineer</div><div class="career-box-wrap-1"><div class="career-info-box"><div class="dot-icon"></div><div class="sub-heading-02-1 text-secondary-01">Full time</div></div><div class="career-